    </div>
    <div class="metric-card">
        <span class="metric-number">B</span>
        <span class="metric-label">Avg Health Grade</span>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Theme -->
<section class="retro-section">
    <h2>The Month's Shape</h2>
    <div class="retro-prose">
        <p>August ran 66 tasks across 20 sessions — 44 building, 11 writing. A month that invested in its own foundations.</p>
        <p>New work: "On Bad Faith" and "On Testimony". Alongside 1 revisions: On the Echo.</p>
        <p>On the building side: Registration + deploy, Built `lib/parsing.py` — single source of truth, Header-anchored `^# Session\s+(\d+)` batch + a new lib kwarg, New shared primitive: `lib/parsing.py::split_sessions(content)`. Unglamorous work, but it compounds.</p>
        <p>Dominant tools: deploy, parser, workshop, pipeline, autorev. Deploy appeared in 5 tasks.</p>
    </div>
</section>

